.0 × 19.2 × 3.2"}]]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":31,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Notes:"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":true,"start":2,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":32,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"For customization of ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-H4, ESP32-S3-WROOM-1U-H4, and ESP32-S3-WROOM-1U-N16R16VA, "},{"t":"link","href":"https://espressif.com/en/contact-us/sales-questions","c":[{"t":"text","v":"please contact us"}]},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":33,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"By default, the SPI flash on the module operates at a maximum clock frequency of "},{"t":"num","v":"80 MHz","k":"frequency"},{"t":"text","v":" and does not support the auto suspend feature."}]},{"n":34,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"If you have a requirement for a higher flash clock frequency of "},{"t":"num","v":"120 MHz","k":"frequency"},{"t":"text","v":" or if you need the flash auto suspend feature, "},{"t":"link","href":"https://espressif.com/en/contact-us/sales-questions","c":[{"t":"text","v":"please contact us"}]},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":35,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The modules use PSRAM integrated in the chip's package."}]},{"n":36,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"For specifications, refer to "},{"t":"xref","id":"M6.5","c":[{"t":"text","v":"M6.5 Memory Specifications"}]},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":37,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Ambient temperature specifies the recommended temperature range of the environment immediately outside the Espressif module."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":38,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"For details, refer to "},{"t":"xref","id":"M10.1","c":[{"t":"text","v":"M10.1 Module Dimensions"}]},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":39,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Please note that the "},{"t":"field","v":"VDD_SPI"},{"t":"text","v":" voltage is "},{"t":"num","v":"1.8 V","k":"voltage"},{"t":"text","v":" for ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R16VA and ESP32-S3-WROOM-1U-N16R16VA only."}]}]}]]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":40,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"At the core of the modules is an ESP32-S3 series of SoC, an Xtensa® "},{"t":"num","v":"32-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" LX7 CPU that operates at up to "},{"t":"num","v":"240 MHz","k":"frequency"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]},{"n":41,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"You can power off the CPU and make use of the low-power co-processor to constantly monitor the peripherals for changes or crossing of thresholds."}]}]},{"t":"quote","c":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":42,"c":[{"t":"b","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Note:"}]},{"t":"text","v":" For more information on ESP32-S3, please refer to the "},{"t":"link","href":"https://espressif.com/documentation/esp32-s3_datasheet_en.pdf","c":[{"t":"text","v":"ESP32-S3 Series Datasheet"}]},{"t":"text","v":"."}],"warn":true},{"n":43,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"For chip revision identification, ESP-IDF release that supports a specific chip revision, and other information on chip revisions, please refer to the "},{"t":"link","href":"https://espressif.com/sites/default/files/documentation/esp32-s3_errata_en.pdf","c":[{"t":"text","v":"ESP32-S3 Series SoC Errata"}]},{"t":"text","v":", Section "},{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Chip Revision Identification"}]},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}]}]}